{"title":"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e43b52fc3c34720225ded5b16172530255f7dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8 + 4}{8 - 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba6a56dc31e5d08c42f2bc41757af3959bdb10c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{8 + 4}{8 - 4} &amp;= \\frac{12}{4}\\\\\n&amp;=\\boxed {\\textbf {(B)}\\ 3}\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley\">2013 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redli